                                "sense_id": "4637ebf7-c9ea-3fb6-8b74-cd43af98b6e4",
                                "text": "Once made Respectable, opposition to Prop. 6 finds us using our energies on a liberal cause, and anyone hesitant to commit himself or herself for structural reasons seems like a sour fart amidst the ballyhoo. We find ourselves once again fighting a reactionary on his terms. Our own Civics Class lectures from our \"educations\" become maps for actions: rallies, debates, celebrity endorsements, competitive fund-raising, publicity, getting caught up in the enervating faddism of \"issues,\" without ever reaching the substance."
